 "description": "<p><b>Overview:</b></p><p>You can brush your pet without scratching their skin because the bristles on a slicker brush are angled.<br/>Great for removing knots from your pet's fur.<br/>Super convenient for pet parents - the brush cleans itself at the touch of a button and all hair can be disposed of directly in the trash.<br/>They are suitable for all breeds, but especially for breeds with longer, curly or wiry coats where there is a risk of tangling and matting.<br/>This Brush makes grooming your pet even more enjoyable. The spray function allows you to condition the coat at the same time. This makes it easier to loosen tangles.</p><p>Our&nbsp;<strong>NEW Pet Hair Brush</strong>&nbsp;has a new feature -&nbsp;<strong>integrated misting</strong>. Thanks to this feature, you can apply a grooming product to your pet's hair while brushing.<br/></p><p><b><br/></b></p><p><b>Product information:</b><br/></p><p>Material: ABS<br/>Charging duration: 150 minutes<br/>Product size: 20.05 * 11.5 * 7cm<br/>Specification: RK56 spray Brushing Comb<br/>Color: White</p><p><br/><b>Packing list:</b></p><p>Pet comb * 1 charging cable * 1</p><p><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/d75864f0-bf61-4d8a-9d04-ed8a5be8a2b8.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/8a902480-abb6-4974-a577-f1d92636ea87.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/92a2b839-9186-44a4-b5b7-6303e638824c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/d6a1cb44-c0a6-4b50-a2df-16c2bd6a8725.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/1e062340-db17-432c-8685-e681c89acbdc.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/ea56b87e-b1bb-4d64-a0a1-b4d717d06c4b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/4c2a8df5-8293-4a2e-ab7e-5c71ce3b3bdd.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/2f76db17-a313-4e13